==== Adding a second Wi-Fi antenna Mod ====
The board cut section the track going to the built-in antenna (coil on the board), and part of a track udischy in Wi-Fi module and add a screen between the connector / cable external antenna.

==== Adding LED Mod ====
|<code>
D2 - WPS
D4 - second USB port
D10 - WAN port on CPU
</code>| 

==== Adding second USB port Mod ====
Need to unsolder not getting the circuit elements, such as, USB port, LED (D4), circuitry for power supply.
This action turns the device D1 => D2

==== Adding WAN port Mod ====
The board can be arranged WAN port (P4).
{{:media:dlink:wan.port.correct.gif|}}

Needed parts:
  - **P4** Ethernet port RJ45 1X1 connector without shield
  - **T2** Single 10/100 Base-tx Lan Magnetic: {{:media:datasheets:12ps6121c.pdf|}}
  - **R196, R197, R201, R202** 75 Ohm 0805 size smd resistor
  - **С136** Electrolytic capacitor (I used 220uF*16V)
  - **U14** Unknown IC (just short circuit pads 3 & 5)

==== Adding WPS button Mod ====
The board involves the installation of a button (SW3) and LED (D2), it is necessary to check.

